+# TASK-260720-3c0ss2 — cycle-4 Windows boundary rework
+
+## Candidate
+
+- Worktree: `/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.temp/TASK-260720-3c0ss2/worktree`
+- Branch: `task/TASK-260720-3c0ss2-build-source-identity`
